  "duration": 65.83,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.74,
      "text": "I grew this account to almost 40,000 followers in the past 35 days, and I'm about to give"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.74,
      "end": 8.24,
      "text": "you the exact system, because in three months everyone will be doing this."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.62,
      "end": 11.66,
      "text": "Right now, AI animated reels are where early TikTok was."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 11.98,
      "end": 16.26,
      "text": "Real-motion graphics, voiceover, and captions made from one prompt, and hardly anyone"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.26,
      "end": 17.2,
      "text": "knows it's possible yet."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 17.4,
      "end": 21.66,
      "text": "But this market fills up fast, and when it does, the ones who started first already have"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 21.66,
      "end": 22.18,
      "text": "the audience."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 22.62,
      "end": 23.8,
      "text": "First come, first served."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 24.16,
      "end": 26.18,
      "text": "And most AI reels look like AI slop."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 26.54,
      "end": 29.34,
      "text": "Mine don't, because the system behind them isn't one prompt."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 29.34,
      "end": 31.72,
      "text": "It's 221 files."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 32.06,
      "end": 35.0,
      "text": "Hook patterns and pacing rules decoded from my viral reels."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 35.3,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "Spring physics, whip pans, and zoom kicks tuned the way my videos use them."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 39.4,
      "end": 42.84,
      "text": "Word-timed kinetic captions where the keyword lands a beat before it's said."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 43.1,
      "end": 46.54,
      "text": "A multi-step audio chain on top of 11 labs mastered for Instagram."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 46.98,
      "end": 50.88,
      "text": "And before you ever see the reel, it scores its own motion and fixes the weak moments."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 51.2,
      "end": 55.74,
      "text": "You type one line into Claude code, cursor, or codex, and it writes, voices, animates,"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 55.88,
      "end": 57.1,
      "text": "and renders the whole reel."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 57.1,
      "end": 61.84,
      "text": "That's what got this account almost 5 million views in a month, and over $2,500 in"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 61.84,
      "end": 62.32,
      "text": "brand deals."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 62.58,
      "end": 64.74,
      "text": "Comment skill, and I'll send you the exact system."
    }
  ],
